//│ ║  l.+1: 	fun differentClauses(receiver) = receiver.method
//│ ║        	                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── The callees of this call require different instances for the contextual parameter 'second' of type Show[B].
//│ ║  l.+1: 	fun differentClauses(receiver) = receiver.method
//│ ║        	                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── The contextual parameter is declared here.
//│ ║  l.XX: 	  using fun show[A, B](using first: Show[A])(using second: Show[B]): Show[Pair[A, B]] =
//│ ║        	                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── One callee selects this instance.
//│ ║  l.XX: 	  using Show[Int] = Show[Int]("int")
//│ ║        	  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── Another callee selects this instance.
//│ ║  l.XX: 	  using Show[Str] = Show[Str]("str")
